# ESP recovery via the setup AP. The host relay (host/esp-provision.py on this host's spare Wi-Fi card, installed by
# tools/host-sockets.sh) needs nothing here; it uses the core keys HOUSE_WIFI_SSID / HOUSE_WIFI_PASSWORD.
# The house's shared setup-AP key: every house-built node (panels, firmware/base.yaml) secures its
# "<name>-setup" AP with it, and the recovery fills it in. make install / make update generate it.
PANELS_AP_PASSWORD=
